{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20058","headline":"舟中喜遇从叔简别後寄上时从叔初擢第归江南郊不从行 · 孟郊","name":"舟中喜遇从叔简别後寄上时从叔初擢第归江南郊不从行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一意两片云，暂合还却分。\n南云乘庆归，北云与谁羣。\n寄声千里风，相唤闻不闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20058.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20058","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}